'''Owpk8xjYaqSEPiOzBEm4NZNIN5EE'''

== Notes ==
* As the Beach has only very few foes dropping Shards (Snarling Driftwoods), if you go for Beach-only runs it is recommended to do so only during Pantheon Bonus Week.  

